        "titel": "One tip to hold on to this",
        "tekst": "Remember CAT as **three verbs and one question**.\n\nThe verbs: **move closer** (convergence), **move away** (divergence), **stay put** (maintenance).\n\nThe question: **how did the other person read it?** Almost every exam-style trap in this theory comes from forgetting that what you intend, what you actually do, and what the listener perceives are three different things.\n\nTest yourself in daily life: next time you phone a parent, a teacher and a friend on the same day, notice how your speed, words and accent shift. That shift is the whole theory."
