        "tekst": "**How the second half of the lecture connects**\n\n**Own explanation.** CAT answers the question \"how do I adjust to this person?\". The rest of the lecture answers two follow-up questions: \"through which channel?\" (channels and McLuhan) and \"what could still block the message?\" (barriers). Keep this chain in mind: **person, then channel, then barriers**. It is also a good structure for any reflection in your individual assignment."
